# Local Claude Code config (permission allowlist for the deploy scripts).
# Untracked rather than shared: build-zip.ps1 stamps a build -dirty from
# `git status --porcelain`, which counts untracked files, so leaving this
# floating would mark every deployment irreproducible.
.claude/
